    "biography": {
      "concept": "Leads the loud-tent meeting under the big canvas, in the Hum (Act 3+)",
      "notes": "The Song Leader runs the meeting under the big canvas tent: three hundred seats, eighty townsfolk, and singing. She is booming, delighted and generous to the point of pressure; second helpings cannot be refused, and everybody is new and thrilled about it. She offers willing hands, as many as you can feed, for any work you name. She does not talk about where the singers come from."
